WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Instead, he threw firearms on the head of an auction house owner of mine.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,320
Isn't this against the rules?

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,480
How can ordinary pearls make people lift off stably?

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,720
It must have a special energy structure

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,500
I have studied anomalous materials for decades

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:17,500
This is more like the biomineralized energy crystals formed in the body

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,380
Bioenergy Crystal Professor Lin

8
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,220
Your inference is too quick, right?

9
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,230
Professor Lin has learned a lot

10
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,510
Can we draw conclusions without a test report?

11
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:28,470
It still sounds like a science fiction setting

12
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,100
The data did not come out

13
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:34,180
No one can take speculation seriously. Why are you laughing?

14
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,580
Be more rigorous

15
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,980
I’ll take out the sample data for discussion first. Sorry.

16
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,400
Professor Lin’s idea is very bold

17
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:45,760
But let’s test it first and then draw conclusions.
